  "authTierOverall": "T1_SIMPLE",
  "authTierRationale": "The only credential mode is a single Pendo integration key. `EndpointConfig.credentials` is typed as the CDK's `AccessToken` (titled \"Private App Credentials\"), and `resources.py` builds `TokenSource(oauth_spec=None, credentials=config.credentials, authorization_header=\"x-pendo-integration-key\")`. Because the header is not the CDK default `Authorization`, the CDK sends the raw token with no `Bearer` prefix. No OAuth spec exists anywhere in the connector, so the user registers no app and supplies no refresh token — one self-serve key only.",

  "unionMisfits": [
